@startuml 27-four-levers
!include theme-oriolrius.puml
title Changing access: four levers
rectangle "**New certificate**\nscope: one person\nwhen: after the old one is gone (expired or revoked)\nnote: bulk renew COPIES old principals" as l1 <<user>>
rectangle "**Mapping change**\nscope: one server\nwhen: next login after the files are deployed\n(even with existing certificates)" as l2 <<file>>
rectangle "**Revoke (KRL)**\nscope: one certificate, everywhere\nwhen: next KRL pull (~15 min)" as l3 <<danger>>
rectangle "**Block**\nscope: one identity, one host\nwhen: next KRL pull (~15 min)" as l4 <<danger>>
l1 -[hidden]right- l2
l3 -[hidden]right- l4
l1 -[hidden]down- l3
caption None of the four closes a session that is already open.
@enduml
